  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ncosx = 12 ÷ 13\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nsin²x + cos²x = 1\n\n(a + b)² + (a - b)² = 2(a² + b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ sinx = 5 ÷ 13\n\n⇒ (1 + sinx)² + (1 - sinx)² = 2(1² + sin²x)\n\n⇒ = 2(1 + (5 ÷ 13)²)\n\n⇒ = 2(1 + 25 ÷ 169)\n\n⇒ = 2 × 194 ÷ 169 = 388 ÷ 169\n\n⇒ cos²x = (12 ÷ 13)² = 144 ÷ 169\n\n⇒ Required value = (388 ÷ 169) ÷ (144 ÷ 169)\n\n⇒ = 388 ÷ 144\n\n⇒ = 97 ÷ 36\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 97 ÷ 36.**",
